  "title": "SmallGroups",
  "abstract": "Lean 4 proofs of four existence theorems: a two-generator, three-relator universal group with infinite cyclic abelianization and a displayed normal generator; an effective two-generator, four-relator family with undecidable triviality and universal nontrivial members; a torsion-free two-generator, four-relator group with undecidable word problem, infinite cyclic abelianization, and a displayed normal generator; and an effective two-generator, five-relator family with undecidable triviality whose members are all torsion-free.",
